      <title>Trump says U.S. won't attack Iran before midterms. And, ICE agent shoots man in NYC</title>
      <author>Brittney Melton</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/10/09/g-s1-147455/up-first-newsletter-hurricane-isaias-ukraine-russia-trump-iran-ice-shooting</link>
