      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.npr.org/2026/10/07/g-s1-146853/up-first-newsletter-long-range-bombers-france-high-school-protest-germany-august-hanning-oct-7-memorial-day</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 10:52:58 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div id="storytext" class="storytext storylocation linkLocation"&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Good morning. You're reading the Up First newsletter. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/newsletter/news" target="_blank"&gt;Subscribe&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; here to get it delivered to your inbox, and &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/podcasts/510318/up-first/" target="_blank"&gt;listen&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt; to the Up First podcast for all the news you need to start your day.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Today's top stories&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New information reveals that, over the weekend, the U.S. removed all long-range bombers &lt;/strong&gt;from the British air base near where five men were arrested last week in a suspected terror plot. A U.S. official who is not authorized to speak publicly told NPR that the decision to abruptly send home a dozen B-1 bombers from Royal Air Force base Fairford was due to a "credible threat" from Iran, which potentially involved a drone attack.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-146851-1" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 5547;         --source-height: 3120;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5547x3120+0+290/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F08%2F88%2F95636b6f45ce82a9d61b33357dad%2Fgettyimages-2297552102.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5547x3120+0+290/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F08%2F88%2F95636b6f45ce82a9d61b33357dad%2Fgettyimages-2297552102.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/5547x3120+0+290/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F08%2